m Sirene, and I asked you to draw an illustration of Harpy a long time ago.\nThis time, I would like to ask you to draw Musht, the animal avatar I use on VRSNS called VRChat.\n\nThe overall image I would like is that of a disturbed animal in an unsafe street corner or back alley. (This is just an image of the atmosphere, so I'll leave it up to you to decide on the background.)\nI don't have a specific pose or anything, but I would be happy if he has an evil look in his eyes and expression.\n\nHe should be holding a paper cigarette in his right hand, have a scar over his left eye and no highlights in his eye.\nHe is wearing a camouflage shirt with a woodland pattern, but you can rearrange it to some extent if it is difficult to draw.\n\nThe proportions are not specified, so you are free to draw as you like.\nYou can choose to draw it in a characteristic or realistic way, whichever you prefer. We would like to see either one, so please feel free to choose whichever you prefer.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/SireneSonCat/status/1513346645253304322", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@narumodoki/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 153390, "client_id": 94740, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/79ae0842/uploads/origins/80520d9d-bfe4-441b-83a9-000b907cddff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92d91e42e2cc5a5d92e6460651abfe03", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/79ae0842/uploads/origins/80520d9d-bfe4-441b-83a9-000b907cddff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92d91e42e2cc5a5d92e6460651abfe03, https://si.imgix.net/79ae0842/uploads/origins/80520d9d-bfe4-441b-83a9-000b907cddff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1b41d67b74002f0b6d313d84ce20127 2x, https://si.imgix.net/79ae0842/uploads/origins/80520